Conditions the answer rests on
condition                      checkable   what it says
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
well-defined treatment         no          Each unit's observed outcome is the
                                           outcome it would have had under the
                                           treatment it actually received.
                                           This needs the treatment to be well
                                           defined: every way of getting the
                                           same level has the same effect.
no interference                no          One unit's treatment does not
                                           change another unit's outcome.
no hidden confounding          no          Among units with the same
                                           adjusted-for values, which
                                           treatment a unit got is unrelated
                                           to the outcomes it would have had.
                                           This holds when the adjusted-for
                                           columns account for the common
                                           causes of transition_navigation and
                                           transition_score and none of them
                                           is affected by
                                           transition_navigation.
overlap                        partly      Every group of units that share the
                                           adjusted-for values had some chance
                                           of each compared level of
                                           transition_navigation.
outcome missing at random      no          Among units with the same treatment
                                           and adjusted-for values, whether
                                           transition_score was recorded is
                                           unrelated to its value.
chance of a recorded outcome   partly      Every group of units that share the
                                           treatment and adjusted-for values
                                           that the question reads had some
                                           chance of a recorded
                                           transition_score.
